OL,3,CThree airlifted to hospital after
OL,4,Cbeach emergency
OL,6,FA man and two children have been
OL,7,Fairlifted to hospital after getting
OL,8,Finto difficulty in the sea off Margate.
OL,10,FThe alarm was raised at around 4.30pm
OL,11,Fon Saturday, July 25 in the busy Main
OL,12,FSands area, following reports that
OL,13,Fswimmers were struggling in the water.
OL,15,FRNLI Lifeguards and the Coastguard
OL,16,Farrived as part of multi-agency
OL,17,Fresponse and rescued those affected.
OL,19,FPolice officers helped to manage
OL,20,Ftraffic in the area and allow the air
OL,21,Fambulance to land.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/2
